{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791688590,"nonce":"jlFYOAxsJw8Fs4/wbCe3tCUc0hQ=","message":"Decision: db backup takes no run lock and opens the database without the schema guard (a database newer than the code can still be backed up); db restore refuses only a backup newer than the code, not a newer live database (rolling back to a pre-migrate backup is exactly that case), and never migrates an older backup (note says the next command migrates it, or with deployment.toml that it stays until jobhunter upgrade). Reason: backup and restore are exempt commands and backup only reads; a lock would block the nightly backup behind a 4 h run.","files":null}]}